  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163054137-8bdde290-e939-4f6a-a788-4842866cb1bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此擴充套件用於 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loot Integrations</a>，可增強</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towns-and-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towns and Towers</a> 建築的戰利品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">戰利品將具備更多樣化，並從相近的原版戰利品表中選出，該表亦包含模組戰利品，以確保與所有新增戰利品的模組相容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">僅需安裝於伺服器端</span><br><img style=\"font-size:18px\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">目前已知無不相容問題，應可與其他模組正常搭配使用。</span></p>",
